third_reading.remarks:
History of HB07436:
2018-03-21: Approval on Second Reading;
2018-05-09: Printed copies distributed;
2018-05-15: Approval on Third Reading
(Y-172 N-0 Abs.- 0);
2018-05-17: Transmitted/received by Senate;
2018-05-17: House requested for a conference with Reps. Romualdo, Lobregat, Cua, Salo, Almario, Gonzales (A.D.), Tan (A.), Escudero, Suansing (E.) and Bravo (A.) as conferees;
2018-05-29: Senate elected Senators Pacquiao, Gatchalian, Pimentel, Ejercito, Zubiri, Escudero, Honasan, Drilon and Aquino as its conferees;
2018-09-12: House rescinded its approval on Third Reading;
2018-09-12: Message of the Senate informing the House that on even date the Senate conferees to the Bicam was recalled and that they adopted HB07436 as an amendment to SB01620;
2019-01-16: Reconsideration and subsequent approval on Second Reading by substitution;
2019-01-17: Printed copies distributed to Members; 
2019-01-21: Approval on Third Reading (Y-180 N-0 Abs.-0)
2019-01-22: Senate reconsidered the adoption on September 12, 2018 of HB07436, Message received by the House on January 23, 2019; 2019-01-22: Senate adopted the revised version of HB07436 as an amendment to SB01620.
